  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The seats unravelled into organic matter, the steering wheel became a hypnotic circle of luminescent intestine, the seat",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 294
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Irene told him that many shamans end up that way, and that’s one reason that we no longer recognise them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1250
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s the only way he’ll one day be able to kill the man who ripped it all away, leaving him alone",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2297
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "An old, abused proverb says all roads lead to Rome. If that’s true, maybe he’ll end up knowing all those roads",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2733
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Perhaps that’s why humans build cities, to protect themselves from the immensity of the world",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3263
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then came Augusto Dal Mare, the traitor, the assassin: Stefano had faced him and defeated him but let him live",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5449
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "he doesn’t use violence when he doesn’t think it necessary, even if he has his own particular idea of necessity",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6476
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The symbolism of your story is right, and magic is made of symbols, and is itself symbol, metaphor",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7075
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He wants order, Michele. He wants peace, quiet, the end of anything epic",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8977
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "the price of quiet is domination, the price of order is the death of creativity. It’s chaos that makes us likenesses of ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9403
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It needs to be destroyed",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15627
        }
      ],
      "words": 5
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s a way of looking at things. In a certain aspect you are a creature of flesh and blood, in another you are made of s",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17232
        }
      ],
      "words": 42
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Tradition is like love: when it becomes habit, it means it’s dead",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15401
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "From tomorrow, he’s preparing to kill a god",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10145
        }
      ],
      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "block": "原句15",
      "no": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And while they sleep in Flesh, in Dream, the most arcane of Aspects, a hound is on the hunt. Wedge is getting closer",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 22598
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    }
